    "emphasized": 300,
    "easing": {
      "note": "Compose LeziEasing; cubic-bezier control points are the shipped material-components-android 1.12.0 AAR values. Enter = emphasizedDecelerate, exit = emphasizedAccelerate (motion-polish ticket 02). Curves only — durations stay in fast/base/emphasized; no second duration table.",
