      "emphasizedAccelerate": [0.3, 0, 0.8, 0.2]
    },
    "note": "Compose LeziMotion; shell main transitions use nonEssentialMillis/leziMotionMillis (ticket 10)"
  },
  "density": {
    "note": "Template structural pads on space grid steps; Compose LeziDensity / LeziThemeExt.density. Elder replaces the template table. Legacy LeziSpacing.CardPad/TopBarHorizontal/SectionGap remain until feature migration.",
